      <div type="layout" source="#source-493-691" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <p source="#source-528-548"><seg source="#source-528-548">第一章　死生</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-548-568"><seg source="#source-548-568">第二章　運命</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-568-597"><seg source="#source-568-597">第三章　道徳―罪悪</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-597-626"><seg source="#source-597-626">第四章　半生の回顧</seg></p>
